OL,3,GNEWSAPM asks council for 'evidence for
OL,4,Asecurity guards'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister wants Essex County
OL,7,FCouncil to "put evidence on the table"
OL,8,Fto justify its decision to employ
OL,9,Fsecurity guards in town and city
OL,10,Fcentres near the Wethersfield asylum
OL,11,Fcentre.
OL,13,FAndy Burnham told BBC Look East the
OL,14,Fdecision to fund patrols in Chelmsford,
OL,15,FBraintree and Colchester was "highly
OL,16,Funusual", adding it was the job of
OL,17,Fpolice to deal with such issues "rather
OL,18,Fthan taking the law into their own
OL,19,Fhands".
OL,21,FEssex Police said crimes linked to the
OL,22,FWethersfield site were very low.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
